Page.selectOption

Select by a value-or-label string or { value?, label?, index? }; arrays select multiple options, while null or [] clears the selection. The select must be enabled, but disabled options remain programmatically selectable. Options: timeout: Maximum wait for the element to become usable in milliseconds; defaults to 3000.

await page.selectOption(selector, valueOrValues, { timeout? })

